{"date":"1999-11-17","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/e9/7e/844_Z2u77.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/e9/7e/844_Z2u77.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/e9/7e/844_Z2u77.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/e9/7e/844_Z2u77.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/e9/7e/844_Z2u77.jpg"},"summary":"二战后的十数年，日本从战败的阴影中逐渐走出，进入了经济高度增长的时代。然而强硬的经济政策也导致失业率的不断攀升，各种反政府武装势力不断抬头，安定的社会治安荡然无存。为了应对这一难题，政府建立了拥有高度自主权的首都圈治安警察机构，通过精良的装备和果断的武力来打击以“党派”为首的反政府组织。随着经济不断发展，崇尚暴力的首都圈警察和“党派”逐渐遭到民众的厌弃和孤立。\r\n在一次激烈血腥的交战中，隶属“党派”的少女阿川引爆炸弹自杀，目睹这一幕的首都圈警察成员伏一贵心灵受到前所未有的冲击。这一刻起，他的人生悄悄发生转变……","name":"人狼 JIN-ROH","name_cn":"人狼","tags":[{"name":"押井守","count":1182,"total_count":20167},{"name":"剧场版","count":1026,"total_count":719232},{"name":"Production.I.G","count":739,"total_count":42169},{"name":"1999","count":557,"total_count":13388},{"name":"冲浦启之","count":448,"total_count":878},{"name":"科幻","count":416,"total_count":250288},{"name":"原创","count":393,"total_count":614658},{"name":"沖浦啓之","count":249,"total_count":392},{"name":"人狼","count":237,"total_count":252},{"name":"ProductionI.G","count":135,"total_count":35044},{"name":"爱情","count":113,"total_count":13523},{"name":"小红帽","count":83,"total_count":89},{"name":"深刻","count":74,"total_count":190},{"name":"神山健治","count":69,"total_count":8560},{"name":"日本","count":59,"total_count":290802},{"name":"Production.IG","count":33,"total_count":4258},{"name":"政治","count":30,"total_count":2322},{"name":"90年代","count":24,"total_count":4037},{"name":"动画电影","count":23,"total_count":43527},{"name":"井上俊之","count":19,"total_count":414},{"name":"电影","count":18,"total_count":13499},{"name":"1990s","count":15,"total_count":1646},{"name":"西尾铁也","count":15,"total_count":147},{"name":"今敏","count":14,"total_count":20422},{"name":"Production_I.G","count":14,"total_count":1739},{"name":"映画","count":12,"total_count":6299},{"name":"1999年","count":10,"total_count":648},{"name":"西尾鉄也","count